# The repo's canonical text form is LF, in the working tree and in the blob alike. These files
# carry Chinese prose and UTF-8 BOMs -- the two `*.ps1` need the BOM for Windows PowerShell 5.1 to
# read them as UTF-8 at all -- so a host that writes CRLF or drops the BOM changes bytes a reader
# depends on. Nothing here needs CRLF: the scripts are run as `pwsh -File`, never as `.cmd`.
* text=auto eol=lf